# AzitWateringGroud (35588), a Rainbow Springs hot springs gourd, a civilian. Its first talk has
# nothing to say: talked to, it opens no window and releases the client (the talk's leading
# ActionFailed, then the release). Its dying hook's script event, which the format cannot render,
# is in tests/ai/hall_watering_test.go.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringGroud
npc gourd 35588 Folk 40 0 0

action gourd
action gourd
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
